        "text_bxwTBP": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p></p><p><strong>SkinCeuticals — Advanced Professional Skincare</strong>Born from decades of skin cancer research at leading US universities, <strong>SkinCeuticals</strong> was established in 1997 with one clear mission: to <strong>improve skin health through advanced science</strong>. Today, they are recognized worldwide as the <strong>pioneers of antioxidant skincare</strong>, trusted by dermatologists, plastic surgeons, and medi-spas in more than 35 countries.</p><p>The brand’s philosophy is simple: <strong>Prevent. Protect. Correct.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Prevent</strong> future skin damage with powerful antioxidants.<br/></li><li><strong>Protect</strong> the skin from environmental aggressors, especially UVA/UVB rays.<br/></li><li><strong>Correct</strong> existing concerns such as fine lines, discoloration, acne, and dullness.<br/></li></ul><p>Every product is backed by cutting-edge clinical research and formulated at pharmaceutical standards for maximum efficacy.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
